# Giant Ring of the ArchSaur

id:world-giant-ring-of-the-archsaur a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Giant Ring of the ArchSaur" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/5f25d0ba9c60c> ;
    oa:kind "megastructure" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "In M39, which the catalogue puts at 965 ly against the article's 1,010 — agreeing to 5%. The cluster's centre supplies the direction; where in a 160 ly radius the ring actually sits is not given." ;
